  },
  "articleBody": "Dreaming of a tiny home is super exciting, but sometimes turning that dream into a concrete plan can feel overwhelming. It’s easy to get stuck on Pinterest boards without knowing how to make it real. Often, the disconnect happens because people approach tiny homes like traditional houses, not realizing the unique considerations involved in small-space living. Zen Tiny Homes starts with your lifestyle, not just a floor plan. We focus on how you'll genuinely use every square foot, whether it's for cooking, sleeping, working, or just chilling out. We consider things like storage solutions, flexible living areas, and even the feeling of openness to make sure your smaller home feels complete and personal. We’ve been at this for over a decade, helping folks in San Diego County and across Southern California navigate these waters. If your vision feels scattered, or you're unsure how to translate your needs into an actual design, it's probably time to chat with specialists who understand tiny home feasibility and design from the ground up.",
